["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">拡大</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かくだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">扩大；扩展；放大；扩大；升级；蔓延</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236817\"><ruby>今年<rp>(</rp><rt>ことし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>事業<rp>(</rp><rt>じぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が５０％<ruby>拡大<rp>(</rp><rt>かくだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">今年,业务增长了50%。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">確認</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かくにん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">确认</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">確</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">隠れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かくれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">隐藏；隐蔽；躲藏；消失（于……之后）；被遮挡；被遮住；从视野中消失；隐居；遁世；不为人知；未被发现；隐而不显；薨逝；去世（用于身份高贵者）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"138184\"><ruby>太陽<rp>(</rp><rt>たいよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>雲<rp>(</rp><rt>くも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のかげに<ruby>隠<rp>(</rp><rt>かく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">太阳在云中隐藏着。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家具</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">家具</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84222\"><ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>家具<rp>(</rp><rt>かぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">房间里没有家具。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">欠ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">出现缺口；破损；碎裂；缺席；不在；丢失；缺乏；不足；欠缺；亏缺；月亏；蚀</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194593\">メアリーは<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いやりに<ruby>欠<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">玛丽缺乏同情心。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">影</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かげ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">影子；轮廓；身影；倒影；映像；不祥之兆；凶兆；光；星光；月光；痕迹；往日风采的残影；背后；后面；另一侧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209181\">その<ruby>少女<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>自分<rp>(</rp><rt>じぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>影<rp>(</rp><rt>かげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>におびえていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那个女孩在自己的影子里害怕。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">陰</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かげ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class