cab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">围绕；包围；圈围；围护；围困；围攻；下（围棋、将棋等）；对弈</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207707\"><ruby>庭<rp>(</rp><rt>にわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のフェンスで<ruby>囲<rp>(</rp><rt>かこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">花园被木栅栏围了起来。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/333146\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">籠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">篮子；筐；笼子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213288\">そのかごはリンゴでいっぱいだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">箱子里充满了苹果。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">火災</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大火；火灾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126127\"><ruby>町<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>真<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ん<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>火災<rp>(</rp><rt>かさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>発生<rp>(</rp><rt>はっせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">市中心发生了火灾。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">菓子</span><span class=\"v-r\" l