Hans\">这本书有一定的价值。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勝ち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">胜利；胜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"151014\"><ruby>試合<rp>(</rp><rt>しあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>勝<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちに<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">比赛以他的胜利结束。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">活気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かっき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">活力；朝气；生气；精力；生机</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211688\">その<ruby>街<rp>(</rp><rt>まち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>活気<rp>(</rp><rt>かっき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあふれていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个城市充满活力。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">活動</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かつどう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">活动；行动；运作；工作；（旧称）电影；影片</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88075\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>活動<rp>(</rp><rt>かつどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>参加<rp>(</rp><rt>さんか</rt><rp>)</rp></ru