a\">必ずしも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かならずしも</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不一定；未必；不必然；并非都</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179680\"><ruby>金持<rp>(</rp><rt>かねも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちが<ruby>必<rp>(</rp><rt>かなら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずしも<ruby>幸福<rp>(</rp><rt>こうふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とは<ruby>限<rp>(</rp><rt>かぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">富人并不一定是幸福的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">かなり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相当地；颇；很；较；比较</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"93031\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかなりの<ruby>洋服<rp>(</rp><rt>ようふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她穿着很多衣服。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かね</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">金钱；钱；金属</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"82995\"><ruby>母<rp>(</rp><rt>はは</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちに<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をわけてやった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">妈妈把钱交给孩子们。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">金持ち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かねもち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">富人；有钱人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179680\"><ruby>金持<rp>(</rp><rt>かねも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちが<ruby>必<rp>(</rp><rt>かなら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずしも<ruby>幸福<rp>(</rp><rt>こうふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とは<ruby>限<rp>(</rp><rt>かぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">富人并不一定是幸福的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">可能</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かのう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">可能的；潜在的；可行的；可实现的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127251\"><ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へのしつけは<ruby>可能<rp>(</rp><rt>かのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">对男孩的攻击是可能的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">株</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">股票；股份；树桩；残株；根丛；带根植株；菌株；菌种；股份公司；株式会社；商誉；职位特权；名声；信誉；人气；专长；特长</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"102421\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>大金<rp>(</rp><rt>たいきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>株<rp>(</rp><rt>かぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>投資<rp>(</rp><rt>とうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他在股票上投资了很多钱。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">被る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かぶる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">戴（在头上）；戴着；从头上套下；蒙住头；自行加冕；蒙上（灰尘、雪等）；被覆盖；往自己身上浇（水等）；淋；（船）上浪进水；承担；承受；负责；肩负；重叠；交叠；相似；重复；冗余；（胶片因曝光过度等）起雾；发灰；（戏剧等）收场；落幕；停演；（戏剧等）满座；客满；票售罄；（戏剧等）演砸；失手；失败；被欺骗；上当</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211546\">その<ruby>機械<rp>(</rp><rt>きかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はほこりをかぶっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">机器穿着尘埃。</span></div></li>"]